## Attack Path Summary

```
nmap -> staging.silentium.htb -> Flowise 3.0.5
  |
  CVE-2025-58434: forgot-password leaks tempToken
  -> reset admin password
  -> login as ben@silentium.htb
  |
  CVE-2025-59528: CustomMCP node RCE
  -> shell in Docker container as root
  |
  env vars leak SSH credentials (r04D!!_R4ge)
  -> ssh ben@10.129.245.103
  -> user.txt
  |
  Gogs 0.13.3 on port 3001, running as root
  CVE-2025-8110: symlink -> .git/config overwrite
  -> sshCommand injection
  -> root shell
  -> root.txt
```

